  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo nacweriiremu kutagaruka kubabungira ndeke kubatuntuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu ndabatuntuza, mara nibaha abarandeetera omuhimbo? Ogu ou ntuntwize? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nikyo nabahandiikiriire, nukwo obu ndiija, ndeke kubiihizibwa abo abaakubaire nibandeetera omuhimbo. Habwokuba nkagumya nti: okusemererwa kwange kuliba kusemererwa kwanyu inywena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabahandiikira nyina obujune bwingi n'obusaasi omu mutima, kandi n'amaizi maingi omu maiso, ntarukugenderra kubatuntuza, baitu okubooleka nkooku mbagonza muno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okuganyira arukusobya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu haraaba haroho ayakozire ekirukusaaliza, atasaalize nyowe nyenka, baitu akabasaaliza inywena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu nk'ogu, ekifubiro eki yahairwe abaingi, nikimumara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haakire mwakumuganyiire mumuhuumuza, nukwo aleke kutereburwa obujune obuhinguraine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo ndukubeesengerereza nti: Mugaruke mumwoleka engonzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo nahandiikiire ningenderra okubalenga, mmanye obu muraaba nimuhurra omu byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weena ou muganyira, na nyowe mmuganyira. Kandi obu haraaba haroho eki naaganyiire, nkakiganyira habwanyu, omumaiso ga Kristo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nukwo tutange Sitaani kutusingura; habwokuba emitego ye tugimanyire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo naaruga Turoha naagenda kuserra Tito",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.20.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebik 20:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu nahikire Turoha kurangirrayo Amakuru Amarungi ga Kristo, oku nkasanga orwigi runkinguliirwe kukora omulimo gwa MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu omutima gwange gutahuumule habw'okutasangayo mugenzi wange Tito. Nukwo kubaraga, nayongera nagenda Makedoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekikuru nukwo kuheereza n'obwesigwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Ruhanga asiimwe, anyakutusinguza butoosa omu Kristo, kandi naakorra omuli itwe kurarangya hoona amakuru ag'okumumanya, amakuru agarukuboya nk'omugaju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba hali abantu abarukujunwa n'abandi abarukuhwerekerra, itwe tuli mugaju gwa Kristo ogurukuboyera Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hali abo abarukuhwerekerra, tuli kijunde ky'orufu ekirukwita; baitu hali abo abarukujunwa, tuli kiboya ky'obwomeezi ekirukwomeeza. Nooha asemeriire omulimo ogu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itwe titurukusisana nk'abaingi, ababungya ekigambo kya Ruhanga kukiihamu amagoba; baitu tuli bantu beesigwa, abaatumirwe Ruhanga, kandi twegeseza omumaiso ge nk'abaheereza ba Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
